  "html": "<h1>Cover Category Keys</h1>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The keys in the <code>cover</code> category control the front and back cover images.\nSee <a href=\"covers.html\">covers.html</a> for examples and more information.</p>\n</div>\n<table class=\"tableblock frame-none grid-rows stretch\">\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 23.0769%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 30.7692%;\">\n<col style=\"width: 46.1539%;\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Key</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Value Type</th>\n<th class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\">Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">back-image</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"covers.html\">image macro</a> | <a href=\"covers.html\">path</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">cover:\n  back:\n    image: image:solid-cover.pdf[]</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\">front-image</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><p class=\"tableblock\"><a href=\"covers.html\">image macro</a> | <a href=\"covers.html\">path</a><br>\n(default: <em>not set</em>)</p></td>\n<td class=\"tableblock halign-left valign-top\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"listingblock\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-yaml\" data-lang=\"yaml\">cover:\n  front:\n    image: image:cover.pdf[page=2]</code></pre>\n</div>\n</div></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"
}
